{% comment %}
  商品ページ（衣裳の詳細）。サンプル product.html から移植。
  - 料金は「レンタル料金」オプションの値ごとに出す（試着は「ご自宅試着」、それ以外は「本使用レンタル（3泊4日）」など）
  - 取扱サイズは「サイズ」オプションの値
  - サイズの目安はドレスだけ（種類に「ドレス」を含む商品）。判定は assets/size-guide.js
  - 「この衣裳で申し込む」は予約ページに型番（code）と誰の衣裳か（who）を付けて渡す
{% endcomment %}
{{ 'product.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'lightbox.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<script src="{{ 'lightbox.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

{%- capture code -%}{% render 'product-code', product: product %}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- liquid
  assign line = product.metafields.custom.line.value
  assign silhouettes = product.metafields.custom.silhouette.value
  assign is_dress = false
  if product.type contains 'ドレス'
    assign is_dress = true
  endif
  if is_dress
    assign who = 'bride'
  else
    assign who = 'groom'
  endif

  assign price_option = nil
  assign size_option = nil
  for option in product.options_with_values
    if option.name contains '料金'
      assign price_option = option
    elsif option.name == 'サイズ'
      assign size_option = option
    endif
  endfor

  # サンプルと同じ基準: DESIGN の記載にビスチェがあるか、DESIGN の記載が無いドレスはビスチェの列で見る
  assign is_bustier = true
  if product.description contains 'DESIGN'
    unless product.description contains 'ビスチェ'
      assign is_bustier = false
    endunless
  endif

  assign reserve_base = section.settings.reserve_link | default: '/pages/reserve'
  assign code_param = code | url_encode
  assign reserve_url = reserve_base | append: '?code=' | append: code_param | append: '&who=' | append: who
  if collection
    assign crumb_collection = collection
  else
    assign crumb_collection = product.collections.first
  endif
-%}

<article class="pd full-width">
  <nav class="pd-crumb" aria-label="{{ 'products.breadcrumb' | t }}">
    <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">{{ 'products.home' | t }}</a>
    {%- if crumb_collection -%}
      <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <a href="{{ crumb_collection.url }}">{{ crumb_collection.title }}</a>
    {%- endif -%}
    <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
    <span aria-current="page" translate="no">{{ code }}</span>
  </nav>

  <div class="pd-grid">
    {%- capture lightbox_labels -%}
      {"dialog": {{ 'products.lightbox.dialog' | t | json }}, "prev": {{ 'products.lightbox.prev' | t | json }}, "next": {{ 'products.lightbox.next' | t | json }}, "close": {{ 'products.lightbox.close' | t | json }}, "open": {{ 'products.lightbox.open' | t: title: '%title%' | json }}, "image": {{ 'products.lightbox.image' | t | json }}}
    {%- endcapture -%}
    <div class="pd-gallery" data-lightbox data-lightbox-labels="{{ lightbox_labels | strip | escape }}">
      {%- for media in product.media -%}
        {%- if media.media_type == 'image' -%}
          <figure class="pd-shot" data-lightbox-item data-full="{{ media | image_url: width: 2000 }}">
            {%- liquid
              if forloop.first
                assign loading = 'eager'
                assign priority = 'high'
              else
                assign loading = 'lazy'
                assign priority = 'auto'
              endif
              assign image_alt = media.alt | default: product.title
            -%}
            {{
              media
              | image_url: width: 1400
              | image_tag:
                widths: '480, 700, 900, 1100, 1400',
                sizes: '(max-width: 520px) 92vw, (max-width: 860px) 46vw, 600px',
                loading: loading,
                fetchpriority: priority,
                alt: image_alt
            }}
          </figure>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- else -%}
        <figure class="pd-shot">{{ 'product-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'pd-placeholder' }}</figure>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>

    <div class="pd-info">
      <p class="chapter-label" translate="no">{{ section.settings.eyebrow }}</p>
      {%- if line != blank -%}
        <p class="pd-line" translate="no">{{ line }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      <h1 class="pd-name" translate="no">{{ code }}</h1>
      <p class="pd-code">
        <span>{{ product.type }}</span>
        {%- if silhouettes != blank -%}
          <span>
            {{- 'products.silhouette' | t -}}:
            {% for s in silhouettes %}{{ s.name.value }}{% unless forloop.last %}・{% endunless %}{% endfor %}
          </span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </p>

      {%- if product.description != blank -%}
        <div class="pd-desc">{{ product.description }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if price_option -%}
        {%- comment -%} 本使用レンタル（3泊4日・7泊8日…）を先に、ご自宅試着を最後に出す（サンプルと同じ順） {%- endcomment -%}
        <dl class="pd-price">
          {%- assign passes = 'rental,trial' | split: ',' -%}
          {%- for pass in passes -%}
            {%- for value in price_option.values -%}
              {%- liquid
                assign is_trial = false
                if value contains '試着'
                  assign is_trial = true
                endif
                if pass == 'rental' and is_trial
                  continue
                endif
                if pass == 'trial' and is_trial == false
                  continue
                endif
                assign option_index = price_option.position | minus: 1
                assign value_price = 0
                for variant in product.variants
                  if variant.options[option_index] == value
                    if value_price == 0 or variant.price < value_price
                      assign value_price = variant.price
                    endif
                  endif
                endfor
              -%}
              <div>
                <dt>
                  {%- if is_trial -%}
                    {{ 'products.price.trial' | t }}
                  {%- else -%}
                    {{ 'products.price.rental' | t: period: value }}
                  {%- endif -%}
                </dt>
                <dd>
                  {{ value_price | money }}
                  {%- comment -%} シューズオプションはドレス（新婦）の試着だけ。タキシードにも要るかは先方に確認中 {%- endcomment -%}
                  {%- if is_trial and is_dress and section.settings.trial_note != blank -%}
                    <span class="pd-price-note">{{ section.settings.trial_note }}</span>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </dd>
              </div>
            {%- endfor -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </dl>
      {%- elsif product.price > 0 -%}
        {%- comment -%} ¥0 の小物は料金を出さない（プランに含まれる扱いか先方に確認中） {%- endcomment -%}
        <p class="pd-price-single">{{ product.price | money }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if size_option -%}
        <dl class="pd-spec pd-sizes">
          <div>
            <dt><span class="pd-spec-en" translate="no">Size</span>{{ 'products.sizes' | t }}</dt>
            <dd>
              <span translate="no">{{ size_option.values | join: ' / ' }}</span>
              {%- if is_dress -%}
                <small class="pd-spec-note">{{ 'products.size_legend' | t }}</small>
              {%- endif -%}
            </dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.notes != blank -%}
        <ul class="pd-notes">
          {%- assign notes = section.settings.notes | newline_to_br | split: '<br />' -%}
          {%- for note in notes -%}
            {%- assign note = note | strip -%}
            {%- if note != blank -%}<li>{{ note }}</li>{%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
      {%- endif -%}

      <p class="pd-cta-wrap"><a class="pd-cta" href="{{ reserve_url }}">{{ 'products.reserve' | t }}</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- if is_dress and section.settings.show_size_guide -%}
    {%- render 'size-guide', section_id: section.id, size_option: size_option, is_bustier: is_bustier, reserve_url: reserve_url -%}
  {%- endif -%}
</article>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:general.product",
  "class": "section-product",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "eyebrow",
      "label": "t:labels.eyebrow",
      "default": "Collection — Détail"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "trial_note",
      "label": "t:labels.trial_note",
      "default": "シューズオプション +¥1,500"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "notes",
      "label": "t:labels.product_notes",
      "info": "t:info.product_notes",
      "default": "ご利用日の4ヶ月前〜10日前までご予約いただけます\nヤマト運輸がご指定の場所へお届け・ご返送はそのまま(お客様でのクリーニングは不要)\nご試着後の本使用予約もオンラインで完結します"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "reserve_link",
      "label": "t:labels.reserve_link",
      "info": "t:info.reserve_link"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_size_guide",
      "label": "t:labels.show_size_guide",
      "default": true
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
